1.npm install 
2. npm install --global eas-cli 
3. npm install -g expo-cli 3. eas login (email/pass) 
4. eas device:list (configure eas) 
5. Go to network profile of home wifi and select private network profile 
6. If that doesnt work, go to command prompt
6.1 ipconfig
6.2 copy ipv4 address
6.3 set REACT_NATIVE_PACKAGER_HOSTNAME={ipv4 address}

Creating development build

1. eas build --profile development --platform ios
2. login (ki...@gmail.com)

Apple prod build
1. Push current code to git
2. Increment app.json
3. eas build --platform ios
4. eas submit -p ios